 ideas. He'd show certain people. He showed me how he voiced Caravan. One day he was - on an occasion he was up at the piano, he motioned to me, come here. I got up and sat down by the piano bench. This is Johnny Hodges. [Bellson sings the melody to Caravan. ] Up chromatically. Here's Russell Procope. Here's Paul Gonsa ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11166$470A4713-2F20-4729-B503-F6FE6C0BAACA", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "aeb9c589d7b698f67cb60ba23bbc46887703b530", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/370.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11166$949A7B27-39E6-41FD-A5DF-16F8CBCA312D", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "69b9c5c0a578a64ca864d215caad6396df0f13b9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 358, "id": "Q358"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11166$80201FC0-7D1B-4066-B518-246E47E983C4", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "a88d2cc734f374aa1dab27db3d909838c9cc888f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 400, "id": "Q400"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11166$C05C1808-F134-4747-8B1C-4A9C51112C48", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "421fee0bd9ffba6025ee7c5fe7cbaa22f56c8fea", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 57, "id": "Q57"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11166$5C6E896D-34A0-4D29-87A3-C53202F48697", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f44662a78c69afa19b69a47805ad4df373539269", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numer